{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075220/extras/695ab90f93156c8041e599055a6aad70.avif?t=1761060310\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;For the past and for the future, I must embark on a journey without hesitation - and then I will start over&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ok We really can't make it up anymore! This is a light hearted, happy, and silly love story of a sand sculpture!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no such thing as black and deep residue, because we can't write!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no bad ending! Because we are too lazy to write!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story takes place entirely in a virtual world! Please do not use three-dimensional thinking to understand!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075220?t=1761060310","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075220/d75a4f73862255f1374472ab1944e6cecd796a9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761060310","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075220/43f97c278c45c9f2e7dea4b4fe2a2be1f10acb91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761060310","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075220/43f97c278c45c9f2e7dea4b4fe2a2be1f10acb91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761060310","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p cla